6.1 Synthesis of Literature
The reviewed material shows that satellite and remote-sensing data can be used to observe changes in vegetation and land cover. However, detecting a change and managing local observations are two different tasks. This creates an opportunity for a small web-based system that presents possible changes on a map and adds citizen observations for context. Aravalli Eye will therefore treat satellite detection as an alert or screening method, not as final legal evidence.
