7.1 Comparative Interpretation
Existing satellite and GIS platforms provide useful data and mapping functions, but a user may need to combine several tools to answer a simple question: which zones need attention? Aravalli Eye proposes one interface where possible changes and citizen observations can be viewed together. A priority score will also help organize cases for verification.
