10. PROJECT SCOPE, OBJECTIVES AND PRELIMINARY REQUIREMENTS
10.1 Aim
To develop a web-based prototype that helps identify possible land-use changes in selected Aravalli zones around Alwar by combining satellite-image comparison, citizen observations and GIS-based visualization.
10.2 Specific Objectives
•	Divide the selected Alwar Aravalli study area into manageable monitoring zones.
•	Compare satellite images from different dates to indicate possible vegetation or terrain changes.
•	Provide a simple form for citizens to submit observations with location and description.
•	Display detected changes and citizen reports on an interactive map.
•	Generate a basic Low/Medium/High priority score to support verification.
