11. EXPECTED OUTCOMES AND INITIAL FEASIBILITY
11.1 Expected Outcomes / Impact
The expected outcome is a working prototype dashboard where a selected Aravalli area can be divided into zones and possible changes can be displayed on a map. Users should be able to submit observations, while an administrator can review reports and their priority. The project can demonstrate how web development, databases, image processing and GIS can be connected to a real local problem.
11.2 Preliminary Feasibility
