Sustainability / Social Impact	The system can later be extended to more zones and additional data sources.
11.3 Risks and Assumptions
•	Cloud cover or image quality may affect satellite comparison.
•	Not every detected change represents illegal activity, so field verification is required.
•	Citizen reports may contain incorrect or incomplete information.
•	Satellite data/API availability and usage conditions may change.
•	The prototype assumes a defined study boundary and suitable historical imagery.
